00:26.017 --> 00:29.941
that's going to be equal to f of zero.

00:29.941 --> 00:32.820
We could view this f of
zero times x to the zero

00:32.820 --> 00:34.399
over zero factorial,

00:34.399 --> 00:36.535
if you assume zero
